---
---

<section id="journey" class="py-24 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12">
  <div class="mb-12 reveal">
    <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[4px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
      Professional Journey
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative pl-8 sm:pl-12 border-l border-[var(--border-frame)] ml-2 sm:ml-4">
    
    <!-- Timeline Item 1 -->
    <div class="relative pb-14 reveal reveal-d1">
      <div class="absolute -left-[33px] sm:-left-[49px] top-1.5 w-6 h-[1px] bg-[var(--text-primary)]">
        <div class="absolute right-0 -top-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--text-primary)]"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-block font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-bold bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-canvas)] px-3 py-1 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
        OCT 2025 — JAN 2026
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">IT Security Intern</h3>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-muted)] block mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Pride Bank Uganda</span>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-body)] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Hands-on experience in enterprise network security, access control policy implementation, and security operations center (SOC) workflows within a regulated financial environment.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Item 2 -->
    <div class="relative reveal reveal-d2">
      <div class="absolute -left-[33px] sm:-left-[49px] top-1.5 w-6 h-[1px] bg-[var(--text-primary)]">
        <div class="absolute right-0 -top-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--text-primary)]"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-block font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-bold bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-canvas)] px-3 py-1 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
        2023 — 2026
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">BSc. Networking & Cybersecurity</h3>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-muted)] block mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Isbat University · Kampala, Uganda</span>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-body)] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Comprehensive study of network architecture, security frameworks, digital forensics, and threat modeling. Final-year project focused on AI-driven vulnerability classification. <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">CGPA: 4.72</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
